        <div><a name="_chinese" id="_chinese"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.8 Chinese</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_c92c017b-638c-47b0-a09c-15629f5ed9cb" id="_c92c017b-638c-47b0-a09c-15629f5ed9cb"></a>Chinese personal names are names used by those from mainland China, Hong Kong,
Macau, Taiwan, and the Chinese diaspora overseas.</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_25dcbd57-e940-477d-9f4d-64482077405f" id="_25dcbd57-e940-477d-9f4d-64482077405f"></a>Chinese names consist of a
family name (&#x59D3;, x&#xEC;ng), followed by
a given name (&#x540D;, m&#xED;ng).</p>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_58969279-b947-4afc-90b9-05eb986cefe2" id="_58969279-b947-4afc-90b9-05eb986cefe2"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo17;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo17;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    given name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_706e78ac-cdfe-453f-b404-069deaf4c07e" id="_706e78ac-cdfe-453f-b404-069deaf4c07e"></a>Some people also utilize a &#x201C;courtesy name&#x201D; or &#x201C;style name&#x201D; (&#x5B57;, z&#xEC;),
by which they were known among those outside their
family and closest friends.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_representations" id="_typical_name_representations"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.8.1 Typical name representations</p><div class="example"><a name="_177a11da-73c0-4138-97c5-449e5a93a355" id="_177a11da-73c0-4138-97c5-449e5a93a355"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;&#x5B6B;&#x6587;&#x201D; (Sun Man), the birth name of the founding father
of the Republic of China &#x201C;Sun Yat-sen&#x201D;:</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.1</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_c092b61a-bf01-4512-a32e-1f5eff50ef32" id="_c092b61a-bf01-4512-a32e-1f5eff50ef32"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x5B6B;</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x6587;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_60733c83-01b6-4d4b-815b-1f02a000ef06" id="_60733c83-01b6-4d4b-815b-1f02a000ef06"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;&#x5B6B;&#x5FB7;&#x660E;&#x201D; (Sun De Ming), the genealogical name (&#x8B5C;&#x540D;):</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.2</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_2d0d47ec-1621-4f88-9162-fd9aea7088f1" id="_2d0d47ec-1621-4f88-9162-fd9aea7088f1"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x5B6B;</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;">&#x5FB7;&#x660E;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
