<div><a name="_examples_11" id="_examples_11"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.31.2 Examples</p><div class="example"><a name="_5a0cc88e-2b28-4ebc-ad8d-dadaed2770aa" id="_5a0cc88e-2b28-4ebc-ad8d-dadaed2770aa"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x41E;&#x442;&#x440;&#x44F;&#x434;&#x44B;&#x43D; &#x413;&#x4AF;&#x43D;&#x434;&#x44D;&#x433;&#x43C;&#x430;&#x430; (&#x201C;Otryadyn G&#xFC;ndegmaa&#x201D;), a Mongolian shooter, has &#x201C;Otryadyn&#x201D; as a patronym, &#x201C;G&#xFC;ndegmaa&#x201D; as given name.</p></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_9c9f643e-6c27-4fdb-82d4-c7c36c96a973" id="_9c9f643e-6c27-4fdb-82d4-c7c36c96a973"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x425;&#x430;&#x43B;&#x442;&#x43C;&#x430;&#x430;&#x433;&#x438;&#x439;&#x43D; &#x411;&#x430;&#x442;&#x442;&#x443;&#x43B;&#x433;&#x430; (&#x201C;Khaltmaagiin Battulga&#x201D;), President of Mongolia.</p></div></div></div>
