        <div><a name="_portuguese" id="_portuguese"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.35 Portuguese</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_fca47f44-970d-43ae-8cd3-6cc7b52ee482" id="_fca47f44-970d-43ae-8cd3-6cc7b52ee482"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo34;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    given name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo34;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle">
    matronymic name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo34;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    patronymic name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_b723a60d-5900-4376-9bf5-5a46e52244db" id="_b723a60d-5900-4376-9bf5-5a46e52244db"></a>Portuguese often have two personal names, although the first may at times be used on its own.</p>
