</div>
<div><a name="_examples_12" id="_examples_12"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.35.2 Examples</p><div class="example"><a name="_5b557d2d-ee61-4347-9c63-84a715874a4b" id="_5b557d2d-ee61-4347-9c63-84a715874a4b"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  1</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>George Agostinho Baptista da Silva</p></div>
<div class="example"><a name="_7873a983-8740-4598-9386-b1b9c1057bba" id="_7873a983-8740-4598-9386-b1b9c1057bba"></a><p class="MsoNormal"><span class="example_label">EXAMPLE  2</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>&#x201C;Ant&#xF3;nio Caetano de Abreu Freire Egas Moniz&#x201D;, Nobel prize winner. He was the
child of &#x201C;Fernando de Pina Rezende Abreu&#x201D; and &#x201C;Maria do Rosario de Almeida e Sousa&#x201D;.</p></div></div></div>
