        <div><a name="_thai" id="_thai"></a><p class="h2Annex">C.45 Thai</p><p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_c18ad32f-5c0d-4f07-91a5-18d4632d7bec" id="_c18ad32f-5c0d-4f07-91a5-18d4632d7bec"></a>name components:</p>

  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo37;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst">
    family name
  </p>
  <p style="mso-list:l3 level1 lfo37;" class="MsoListParagraphCxSpLast">
    given name
  </p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_f2825ecc-1aa4-4a2e-bbf4-cb211eb28aca" id="_f2825ecc-1aa4-4a2e-bbf4-cb211eb28aca"></a>Modern Thai names are composed of given names followed by the family name.
Prior to 1913, family names were not required.</p>
<div><a name="_typical_name_patterns_15" id="_typical_name_patterns_15"></a><p class="h3Annex">C.45.1 Typical name patterns</p><p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.49</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_aa1c1f76-ab8c-426e-aeeb-3c7d6d52251d" id="_aa1c1f76-ab8c-426e-aeeb-3c7d6d52251d"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td></tr></tbody></table></div>
<p class="TableTitle" align="center">Table C.50</p><div align="center"><table style="mso-table-lspace:15.0cm;margin-left:423.0pt;mso-table-rspace:15.0cm;margin-right:423.0pt;mso-table-bspace:14.2pt;mso-table-anchor-vertical:paragraph;mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;" class="MsoISOTable" border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"><a name="_f6b76ad5-68e7-4854-bb7a-799af26796cc" id="_f6b76ad5-68e7-4854-bb7a-799af26796cc"></a><tbody><tr><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">given name</td><td align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;">family name</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>
